!}
go-to: root

The copy is locked in the safe of a party that has decided to say nothing. It is a prudent choice and Moscow, when it hears of it, will be glad. It is also a choice to have been trusted with a paper and to have used it for nothing: what the letter says will be said, if at all, by someone else, at a time and in a way that suits them.
